# Downloaded/decompiled game content and private profiling artifacts.
*.jar
# The jsr305 annotation library is a third-party compile-time dependency, not game
# content: Mojang's jars before 1.21.11 reference javax.annotation.Nullable but never
# shipped the jar, so javac crashes without it on the classpath.
!tools/jsr305-3.0.2.jar
*.class
*.jfr
*.hprof
